    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-2",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "If you have an early access code, sign in with GitHub or…",
      "text": "If you have an early access code, sign in with GitHub or Google using a verified email address, then enter your **Early access code** when the app asks. A code is a one-time invite code: it works for one account and may expire or be revoked before it is used. It admits your account to the app; it does not grant access to another team’s workspace or files.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
