    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "A workspace is your team’s home. If a teammate invited…",
      "text": "A workspace is your team’s home. If a teammate invited you, accept the invitation from your app home after signing in. Invitations are tied to the email address they were sent to and expire after seven days.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-5",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Most teams organize a workspace as projects, such as web,…",
      "text": "Most teams organize a workspace as projects, such as web, iOS or marketing. Agencies and companies with several products can turn on **Products** under **Workspace settings → General** and group projects under each product. Products are off for new workspaces, and you can use the workspace root directly at any time.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
