      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-7",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Start with a short `AGENTS.md`, a decision log, or a…",
      "text": "Start with a short `AGENTS.md`, a decision log, or a project overview. Keep it current and give it a clear name. Put guidance that applies to everyone at the workspace root and project-specific guidance in the project. Folders organize files inside a location without changing who can access them.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
