      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-8",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Senior access allows direct changes. Junior access submits…",
      "text": "Senior access allows direct changes. Junior access submits changes for review. Workspace administration and content access are separate responsibilities.",
